      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Given `nums`, return the maximum amount you can rob without robbing adjacent houses."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Approach: DP with Two Variables"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "data": {
        "title": "O(n) O(1)",
        "language": "csharp",
        "code": "public int Rob(int[] nums)\n{\n    int prev1 = 0, prev2 = 0;\n    foreach (int num in nums)\n    {\n        int curr = Math.Max(prev1 + num, prev2);\n        prev1 = prev2;\n        prev2 = curr;\n    }\n    return prev2;\n}"
      }
    },
